        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sterling Archer, Burt Reynolds, Malory Archer, Jessica Walter, H. Jon Benjamin\n- Works: The Man from Jupiter, Play Misty for Me, Grand Prix, Arrested Development, Archer\n- Roles: Lucille Bluth\n\nFacts:\n- In The Man from Jupiter, Sterling Archer is introduced to Burt Reynolds.\n- In The Man from Jupiter, Burt Reynolds is involved in a relationship with Malory Archer.\n- H. Jon Benjamin voices Sterling Archer.\n- Jessica Walter voices Malory Archer in the FX animated series Archer.\n- Jessica Walter is known for appearing in the films Play Misty for Me and Grand Prix.\n- Jessica Walter is known for her role as Lucille Bluth on the sitcom Arrested Development.",
